  "decisionReason": "国际区TTS在三个连续窗口出现可重复的服务端时延上行，粗输出大小分组也上升；代理侧定位到连接建立后、模型响应头返回前的等待阶段。未新增HTTP/模型失败，具体排队/推理/编码原因仍未证实。",
  "limitations": [
    "No absolute product latency SLO was supplied; regression is relative to three observed request cohorts, not a timeout-budget failure.",
    "No user content, client events or client code inspected; server latency does not prove a playback interruption.",
    "Model queue, inference/frontend and encoding are not separately timed in this evidence; do not invent a precise internal cause.",
    "Global exact per-invocation join is ambiguous for 12 provider requests sharing 4 application keys. All affected returned HTTP200; ambiguity is retained instead of counted as failure.",
    "One unique Global match has no proxy completion inside the slice; returned Global completion is retained and later proxy evidence must settle the boundary.",
    "34 independent attempt1 groups/admissions are absent from the returned cohort; two repeated-key groups each contain one more proxy admission than returned provider invocations. Caller/deployment and ingestion completeness remain unknown.",
    "CN clone and QuickRead, plus US clone, still lack representative fixed-window samples. Health and lifetime counters do not replace those samples.",
    "QuickRead ready jobs are modified-file cohorts, not all new jobs or complete HTTP request ledgers; generated text does not prove downstream audio completion.",
    "Old Direct3×400,1×502,4×504 and Global core4×504 stay retained and unchanged. Direct12 current-window disconnect keys remain; no response is neither HTTP success nor failure.",
    "The original final window still ends2026-09-07T18:37:52.522573Z; CN R134 was not deployed.",
    "Observed region metadata and frozen source identity are not a complete physical cross-border-free certification."
  ],
